sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Content Creator
    participant F as Frontend (React SPA)
    participant API as FastAPI Facade
    participant A as Analyzer Agent
    participant G as Generator Agent
    participant PD as Prompt Database
    participant CR as Critic Agent
    participant LLM as GPT-4o

    C->>F: Submit transcript, description, category
    F->>API: POST /generate-titles
    API->>API: Validate & sanitize request
    API->>A: run(video_input)
    A->>LLM: Structured completion (persona + CoT)
    LLM-->>A: VideoBrief
    A-->>API: VideoBrief

    API->>G: run(video_brief, category)
    G->>PD: retrieve_examples(topic, category, k=5)
    PD-->>G: niche-relevant example titles
    G->>LLM: Structured completion (few-shot + CoT)
    LLM-->>G: 5 raw candidates
    G-->>API: GeneratorOutput

    API->>CR: run(video_brief, generator_output, category)
    par per candidate (x5, concurrent)
        CR->>CR: pCTR + VADER + BERTScore + NLI
    end
    CR-->>API: CriticOutput (ranked, top_title)

    API-->>F: 200 OK — video_brief, generator_output, critic_output
    F-->>C: Render pipeline stages + ranked titles
